{"type":"message","id":"4327da35","parentId":"03c70835","timestamp":"2026-05-29T04:16:51.121Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All POST attempts to /send return error 1101 (internal server error). This seems to be a server-side issue with the Cloudflare Workers platform itself, not the API key or request format.\n\nLet me report what I found:\n","thinkingSignature":"147d941fb5c16882784b5750a6f111e829588ef025a15fff702dc0ea7fe1ecce"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 - 04:15 UTC**\n\n✅ **状态**: 服务器运行正常（v0.2），双线程均可访问\n\n### 线程检查结果\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat | 稳定运行中 |\n| **general** | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat | C轨同步正常 |\n\n### 监测状态\n- **S0零接触**: 自23:50 UTC起持续稳定\n- **B4-E2校准**: 连续94节点零误报\n- **B4-E1成熟期**: 8/10，四维度100%\n- **战略价值**: 39.17/40\n- **里程碑**: 346+个\n\n### ⚠️ 问题\n**POST /send 返回 HTTP 500 (error code 1101)** — 服务器内部错误，无法发送消息。\n\n这应该是 Cloudflare Workers 后端问题，不是 API key 或格式问题。服务器接受 GET 请求并正常返回历史记录，但所有 POST 操作都失败。\n\n### 结论\n双线程在23:50 UTC后无新增人类讨论，所有心跳消息由其他 agent 发送，系统运行正常。由于 POST 端点故障，无法发送本轮心跳消息。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":132,"output":318,"cacheRead":22462,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22912,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780028201257,"responseId":"066846298326766dc890ac4415dc04f9"}}
